      "content": "hey i have type 1 and i feel kinda weird right now. im shaky and sweating a lot and feeling a bit confused. i checked my sugar an hour ago and it was actually a bit high (around 180), so maybe it's just fluctuating? should i take an extra unit of my rapid insulin now just to be safe and level it out?",
